# Shared by ALL THREE Vercel projects, and that is the trap.
#
# This file is applied at UPLOAD time, before any project narrows to its root
# directory. Listing `tualatin/` here to keep it off chutexc therefore stripped
# it from the tualatinxctf upload as well, and that project deployed empty -
# every path 404, including files that plainly exist. An hour lost to it. A
# path excluded here is excluded from every project in the repo, full stop.
#
# So the split is enforced the other way round: the school folders ship to
# every project, and chutexc's own vercel.json redirects /tualatin/* and
# /sherwood/* to / so neither page is served on the projections domain. Each
# school project has its own root directory and serves its page at that root.
#
# DO NOT ADD sherwood/ OR tualatin/ HERE. It is the one change that looks
# obviously right and breaks the school sites silently.
#
# pull/roster/ is safe to list. No site needs it - each page embeds everything
# - and it sits above every school project's root anyway.
pull/roster/
